# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev`. COMMITTED as a template -- copy to
# .dev.vars and fill in. Never put real values in this file.
#
# Production does NOT read this. Set production values with:
#   wrangler secret put <NAME> --config wrangler.production.jsonc
#
# systeme.io API key, used to sync newsletter signups to the contact list.
# Get it from: systeme.io dashboard -> profile settings -> "Public API keys".
# Optional: with no key, signups still persist to D1, they just are not
# forwarded to systeme.io (the row's sync_error records why).
SYSTEME_API_KEY=
